      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 4 year old just woke up with a fever and these tiny red/purple spots all over his stomach and legs. i tried pressing a clear glass against them to see if they went away but they didnt stay red even with the pressure. is this just some kind of heat rash or maybe a virus? i dont want to take him to the er if it's just something minor",
